# Pairs with SagaSettles. The discard is routed through the logical alias, so the
# retained redirect on the copy the saga left refuses it for as long as the
# restore is not reverted, and the saga can never decide.
MODULE: SagaSettlesDiscardRouted
TARGET: SagaSettles
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the discard is refused by the redirect of the copy it targets
PERTURBS: Discard
DEADLOCK: off

--- FIND
    /\ c \in left \ disc
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![c] = [k \in Keys |-> FALSE]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ c \in left \ disc
    \* MUTATION: a routed discard, refused by a retained redirect.
    /\ RoutedAdmits(c)
    /\ pend' = [pend EXCEPT ![c] = [k \in Keys |-> FALSE]]
--- END